  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Investment Project for Khaas Food Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The enterprise sources the high -quality food items from a wide network of contract farmers/suppliers and manufacturers. These stakeholders sign contracts with Khaas Food to become the enterprise suppliers. There are around 11 agents across different areas responsible for the collection of produce, ensuring effective backward linkage of the supply chain. The products are supplied to the central warehouse, where it is processed and packaged. Some product categories are directly procured by the Enterprise sourcing team e.g. honey. After procurement and packaging, goods are sold via online and offline channels. Khaas Food currently has 15 operational stores across Bangladesh, 4 of which are outside Dhaka  - 2 in Chittagong, 1 in Cumilla and 2 in Sylhet. Customers can buy Khaas Food products either via online order or in store purchase.</narrative>
  </description>
